<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
    <title>Password Reset Request</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f7f7f7; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      .container { max-width: 500px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-top: 4px solid #15803d; }
      h2 { color: #111; margin-top: 0; font-size: 20px; }
      p { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4b5563; }
      .otp-container { text-align: center; margin: 25px 0; }
      .otp { display: inline-block; padding: 14px 28px; background: #f0fdf4; color: #166534; font-size: 26px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 6px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px dashed #bbf7d0; box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.02); }
      .warning-text { font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; background: #f9fafb; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; margin-top: 20px; }
      .footer { margin-top: 35px; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-size: 12px; color: #888; text-align: center; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Password Reset Request</h2>
      <p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>
      <p>We received a request to reset your password for your CraftBridge System account. Please use the verification code below to authorize this change:</p>
      
      <div class="otp-container">
        <div class="otp"><%= otp %></div>
      </div>
      
      <p>This security credentials code is temporary and will automatically expire in <strong><%= expirationMinutes %> minutes</strong>.</p>
      
      <p class="warning-text">⚠️ <strong>Security Notice:</strong> If you did not initiate this change request, your password is safe and you can securely disregard this email notification message.</p>
      
      <div class="footer">&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> CraftBridge System. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
